se justice<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/22a7fd30b3914200621d5c470a3a0fea.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div> Call to account those who turned on your dynasty<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/22a7fd30b3914200621d5c470a3a0fea.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div> Decide whether to let them live the rest of their lives in the dungeon or execute them<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/8475938280f17a4455944567fd2fb00b.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/676e16b7c6e07617840a723332b6eda0.poster.avif?t=1752219532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/676e16b7c6e07617840a723332b6eda0.webm?t=1752219532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/676e16b7c6e07617840a723332b6eda0.mp4?t=1752219532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>However, eloquent speeches and careful planning are not always a universal remedy. Sometimes you need to use brute force to reach the desired outcome.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/35e3538c01a6a10247bceedc9562b4f4.avif?t=1752219532\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/22a7fd30b3914200621d5c470a3a0fea.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div> To take back what is yours<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/22a7fd30b3914200621d5c470a3a0fea.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div> To prevail against those who want your death<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/22a7fd30b3914200621d5c470a3a0fea.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div> However, be careful who you are challenging. Some adversaries are not going to surrender even to the King.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324830/extras/f88c54f5988c39419f41b6ce0f472e26.webp?t=1752219532\" /></div>",
